        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8531T, Traditional Turino Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Turino Lever with Quincy Rose is a classic, with beautiful detailing that is great for picking up some of the more dynamic finishes like oil rubbed bronze. This Traditional Turino Lever with Square Rose is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. It is easy to install and will fit 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors that are 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Turino Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Turino Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Turino Lever with Quincy Rose",
                "description": "The Turino Lever with Quincy Rose is a classic, with beautiful detailing that is great for picking up some of the more dynamic finishes like oil rubbed bronze. This Traditional Turino Lever with Square Rose is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. It is easy to install and will fit 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors that are 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
